    {
      "type": "Text",
      "props": {
        "id": "Text-a1621e0b-93f4-4282-ba9e-02182f689e21",
        "text": "<p>This classroom project was an Ikat workshop which involved different activities of studying traditional ikat techniques across the world, conceptualizing, designing and executing the designs under the guidance of traditional ikat experts. Ikat being one of the famous Indian textiles, I wanted to combine it with another Indian art form. My inspiration for the ikat weaving was the very famous dance form of Orissa, that is the Odissi dance.</p>",
        "style": "body",
        "align": "start",
        "measure": "normal",
        "layout": {
          "width": "text",
          "space": "s",
          "show": "all",
          "motion": "none"
        }
      }
    },
